[A] 平移不变恒等式 (N=1024, SU(3) 2D Weyl, theta=pi, beta=2.5, lam=(1,0,-1)):
    S=<Phi''+H>, D=Var(Phi'+G), gap=S-D;  匹配核 (Phi=-log 密度) 必须给 0
     beta   Phi / 权重         S              D              S-D           
     2.50   Phi_A/matched    +8.59367558    +8.59366902    +0.00000656   
     2.50   Phi_A/A          +8.59367558    +8.59366902    +0.00000656   
     0.00   Phi_A/matched    +8.00000000    +8.00000000    +0.00000000   
     0.00   Phi_A/A          +8.00000000    +8.00000000    +0.00000000   
     => 匹配核 gap = 0 (beta=0 精确 0; beta=2.5 的是 O(h^2) 差分离散残留, 见下)

     [A1] 匹配核 (beta=2.5) 的 h^2 收敛, 证明残差不是物理:
          N      gap(Phi_A, 匹配)
          256    +1.050e-04
          512    +2.624e-05
